<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">Hello,</font></font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">Do you have students looking for a summer project that can impact their community in a positive way?</font></font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">We are looking for students at your high school who would be interested in sponsoring a summer blood drive between June 1</font><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif" size="-1"><sup>st</sup></font><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">-August 31</font><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif" size="-1"><sup>st</sup></font><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">. All students who collect a minimum of 25 pints of blood will be entered to win a $1000 scholarship for college! All students who reach their goal will receive a $50 gift card as a thank you! (see video below)</font></font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></font><br />
<font face="Calibri,sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">This is a great opportunity to make a difference and help the American Red Cross maintain a healthy blood supply for our patients. Would you consider making an impact this summer? If you or your students have questions please contact me directly. (Tabitha Bagwell&nbsp;</font><a href="tel:(828)%20803-2884" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">828-803-2884</font></a><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">&nbsp;or email&nbsp;</font><a href="mailto:Tabitha.bagwell@redcross.org" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><font face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">Tabitha.bagwell@redcross.org</font></a><font color="#1F497D" face="Arial Narrow,sans-serif">)</font></font><br />
